sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Администратор
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant C as Admin Controller
    participant M as Room Service
    participant F as Room Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    A->>UI: Изменить комнату
    UI->>C: PUT /api/admin/rooms/{id}
    C->>M: update(id, dto)
    M->>F: findById/save
    F->>DB: UPDATE meeting_rooms
    DB-->>F: row updated
    F-->>M: Entity
    M-->>C: Entity
    C-->>UI: 200 OK
